; lighthouse_top.room - Lanterna do Farol (design 04 section 3.3): a flat floor (row 21, cols 3-36) under the lantern's
; roof, with the hatch door (col 36, against the east wall) down to lighthouse_interior, always open (STORY-34).
; The mentor (STORY-34, systems/story) stands at x 720 facing west to the lowered lamp (x 656), his back to the hatch:
; his talk starts as Ivo comes near from the east (col 23, legend t, auto); in stasis, Up on him says "..." (col 22,
; legend t). Once the four guardians are restored he waits there still until Ivo nears, wakes (STORY-38, mentor_wakes)
; and his guardian body holds the final arena (GRD-06): the arena ends at x 1152, and the grey wall (col 35, rows 3-20,
; up to the roof, which Ivo's 144 px jump cannot clear) closes the hatch's pocket while the fight is on.

